"Ne^'u ho^.p na`y ddu+o+.c cho.n, KDE se~ cho phe'p ba.n du`ng <em>"
"Tu+` khoa' Internet</em> trong  thanh ddia. chi? cu?a tri`nh duye^.t web . Nghi~a la` ba.n"
"chi? ca^`n go~ 1 tu+` tho^ng thu+o+`ng nhu+ \"KDE\", dde^? ddu+o+.c redirect"
"tru+.c tie^'p dde^'n site thi'ch ho+.p . DDe^? bie^'t the^m chi tie^'t, xin ghe' tha(m"
"<b>http://www.internetkeywords.org</b> hay chi? ca^`n go~ <b> IKW Dev </b>"
"trong thanh vi. tri' cu?a tri`nh duye^.t ."

