"Trong module na`y, ba.n co'  the^? cho.n du`ng hay kho^ng du`ng ca'c tu+`"
"khoa' Internet . Ba.n cu~ng co' the^? ca^'u hi`nh nhie^`u ma'y ti`m kie^'m ma` KDE co'"
"the^? du`ng dde^? ti`m kie^'m ca'c tu+` khoa' . No' cho phe'p ba.n, vi' du., nha^.p mo^.t"
"gia? - URI nhu+ gg:smetana dde^? ti`m tre^n ma'y ti`m kie^'m google ca'c trang"
"web ve^` nha` soa.n nha.c Se'c Bedrich Smetana ."

